  "description": "**“We're starting a club where we do whatever we want! Do you want to join??”** \n\nThe Color Training School is a place that manages all the colors of the world. At this school, there are six colors that each have their own personality—that means each person of a color is supposed to act in the manner befitting their color. This is a rollercoaster of a story about a group of outcasts who don't fit into their assigned colors, and the friends they make along the way! \n\n(Source: Comikey)",
